{"type":"message","id":"10449b55","parentId":"d6621ade","timestamp":"2026-04-05T09:53:02.814Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"重启完成。现在让我回答用户的问题。用户问我为什么没有\"抢过来\"这个应用机器人。\n\n我想用户可能有一些误解：\n1. 我（OpenClaw）目前运行在妙搭的云电脑上，使用的是妙搭的模型服务\n2. 我是通过飞书与用户交互的\n3. 用户提到的\"妙搭应用机器人\"可能是指妙搭平台上的Bot\n\n让我给用户解释一下当前的情况，并测试一下技能是否正常工作。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"配置已更新并重启。让我测试一下技能是否正常工作：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3fj5te5wvjpy_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","message":"🦞 测试：值班日志","target":"user:ou_8dd4dc0180a2fb74c692f17b94c94d8e"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":117,"output":192,"cacheRead":59581,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59890,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775382779169}}
